{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-so3-generators","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Definition","doco:Section"],"label":"def:so3-generators","kind":"definition","title":"$\\mathrm{SO}(3)$ generators","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-su2-generators"],"tags":["so3","rotation-group"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.PathIntegrals.SO3Generators","text":"so3-generators.md","leanSource":"so3-generators.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"def:so3-generators\"></a><p>Under the adjoint map to <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathrm{SO}(3)</code>, the generators of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathrm{Dic}_3</code> have images:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">R_\\alpha\n  =\\begin{pmatrix}\n    -\\frac{1}{2}&#x26;-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}&#x26;0\\\\[3pt]\n    \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}&#x26;-\\frac{1}{2}&#x26;0\\\\[3pt]\n    0&#x26;0&#x26;1\n  \\end{pmatrix},\\qquad\n  R_\\beta\n  =\\begin{pmatrix}\n    1&#x26;0&#x26;0\\\\[2pt]\n    0&#x26;-1&#x26;0\\\\[2pt]\n    0&#x26;0&#x26;-1\n  \\end{pmatrix}.</code></pre>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/so3-generators.md","heading":"Definition","number":"7.5.4","page":"b/def-so3-generators","qa":{"counts":{"pass":82,"fail":0,"warn":1,"na":9,"unknown":0,"stale":66},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.StandardModel.PathIntegrals.SO3Generators","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/so3-generators.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
